# Rocci language reference

A `.rocci` file is a Roc module with explicit template and server declarations.
Everything outside recognized `@` forms stays Roc. This page is the map; each
subpage is the canonical contract.

| Page | Covers |
| --- | --- |
| [File structure](/docs/reference/language/file-structure/) | Module header, Roc regions, top-level forms, order |
| [Components](/docs/reference/language/components/) | Declaration, params, defaults, body parameter, generated shape |
| [Tags and fragments](/docs/reference/language/tags/) | HTML, calls, fragments, void, name rules |
| [Attributes and actions](/docs/reference/language/attributes/) | Static, dynamic, boolean, Datastar `@get`/`@post`/… |
| [Text and interpolation](/docs/reference/language/text/) | `{expr}`, `Str`, Html bodies, escaping |
| [Directives](/docs/reference/language/directives/) | `@let`, `@if`, `@for`, `@match` |
| [CSS](/docs/reference/language/css/) | File vs component `@css`, scoping, limits |
| [Fixtures](/docs/reference/language/fixtures/) | `@fixture` grammar and discovery |
| [Server declarations](/docs/reference/language/server/) | `@context` `@init` `@view` `@patch` `@command` `@live` |
| [Comments and whitespace](/docs/reference/language/comments/) | `#`, `<!-- -->`, `@@`, `## `, indentation |
| [Generated Roc](/docs/reference/language/generated-roc/) | Lowering table and source maps |
| [Grammar and limits](/docs/reference/language/grammar/) | Reserved forms, removals, unsupported JSX-like features |

Coverage fixture: `test/AllSyntax.rocci` (compiler density, not a tutorial).
Contributor tree spec: [Rocci tree appendix](/docs/reference/contributor/rocci-tree/).

**Support:** current unless a subpage marks a form experimental, planned, or removed.
